{"title": "Edge 与 8B 对比（同一句话）", "rows": [{"lesson": "zh · chemistry/carbon", "key": "8a8f03e9", "send": "地表吸收阳光后发出红外辐射。CO2 等温室气体会吸收并重新发出部分红外辐射。自然温室效应使地球保持温暖；人为增加的 CO2 会加强这一效应。箭头只表示方向和相对变化。  〔朗读稿：地表吸收阳光后发出红外辐射。CO二等温室气体会吸收并重新发出部分红外辐射。自然温室效应使地球保持温暖；人为增加的CO二会加强这一效应。箭头只表示方向和相对变化。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/chemistry/carbon/zh/8a8f03e9.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__chemistry__carbon__8a8f03e9__raw.mp3", "sec": 18.7, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__chemistry__carbon__8a8f03e9__say.mp3", "sec": 18.7, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · china/seas-islands", "key": "e918438a", "send": "海南岛。海南省，热带海岛。面积约3.4万平方千米，是我国第二大岛。终年如夏，有椰林、海滩和橡胶林；三亚在它的南端。海南省还管辖着南海诸岛。  〔朗读稿：海南岛。海南省，热带海岛。面积约三点四万平方千米，是我国第二大岛。终年如夏，有椰林、海滩和橡胶林；三亚在它的南端。海南省还管辖着南海诸岛。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/china/seas-islands/zh/e918438a.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__china__seas-islands__e918438a__raw.mp3", "sec": 16.9, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__china__seas-islands__e918438a__say.mp3", "sec": 16.9, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · math/sampling", "key": "da2dc090", "send": "揭晓真相：300 颗中有 90 颗红珠，正好 百分之30。两个点堆的中心都在 百分之30 附近。这就是统计推断：随机样本中的比例，是总体比例的合理估计。  〔朗读稿：揭晓真相：三百颗中有九十颗红珠，正好百分之三十。两个点堆的中心都在百分之三十附近。这就是统计推断：随机样本中的比例，是总体比例的合理估计。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/math/sampling/zh/da2dc090.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__math__sampling__da2dc090__raw.mp3", "sec": 15.9, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__math__sampling__da2dc090__say.mp3", "sec": 15.3, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · math/negative-operations", "key": "7f5e4109", "send": "乘法表示几个相同的组。 3 乘 2 是 3 组、每组 2 个黄片：6。 3 乘 (负2) 是 3 组、每组 2 个红片： 负6 。正数乘负数得负数。  〔朗读稿：乘法表示几个相同的组。三乘二是三组、每组两个黄片：六。三乘负二是三组、每组两个红片：负六。正数乘负数得负数。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/math/negative-operations/zh/7f5e4109.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__math__negative-operations__7f5e4109__raw.mp3", "sec": 13.8, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__math__negative-operations__7f5e4109__say.mp3", "sec": 13.4, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · china/chinese-spirit", "key": "75f2ff76", "send": "1964年，袁隆平。袁隆平找到一株雄性不育的水稻。  〔朗读稿：一九六四年，袁隆平。袁隆平找到一株雄性不育的水稻。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/china/chinese-spirit/zh/75f2ff76.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__china__chinese-spirit__75f2ff76__raw.mp3", "sec": 6.2, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__china__chinese-spirit__75f2ff76__say.mp3", "sec": 6.2, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · earth/natural-resources", "key": "cc7b1ef6", "send": "煤。由古代沼泽植物形成的化石燃料。煤是大约 3 亿年前沼泽中的植物被埋藏后，经过数百万年的挤压和加热形成的。发电厂燃烧煤把水烧开，蒸汽推动汽轮机发电。看看岩层中黑色的煤层。燃烧煤释放的二氧化碳是所有燃料中最多的，还会产生导致雾霾和酸雨的污染物；采煤会破坏土地。  〔朗读稿：煤。由古代沼泽植物形成的化石燃料。煤是大约三亿年前沼泽中的植物被埋藏后，经过数百万年的挤压和加热形成的。发电厂燃烧煤把水烧开，蒸汽推动汽轮机发电。看看岩层中黑色的煤层。燃烧煤释放的二氧化碳是所有燃料中最多的，还会产生导致雾霾和酸雨的污染物；采煤会破坏土地。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/earth/natural-resources/zh/cc7b1ef6.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__earth__natural-resources__cc7b1ef6__raw.mp3", "sec": 28.5, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__earth__natural-resources__cc7b1ef6__say.mp3", "sec": 28.4, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · chemistry/periodic-table", "key": "690853da", "send": "镉。过渡金属。原子序数 48。第 3–12 族，位于周期表中部。坚硬、有光泽，导热导电性好，例如铁、铜、金、银。  〔朗读稿：镉。过渡金属。原子序数四十八。第三到第十二族，位于周期表中部。坚硬、有光泽，导热导电性好，例如铁、铜、金、银。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/chemistry/periodic-table/zh/690853da.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__chemistry__periodic-table__690853da__raw.mp3", "sec": 14.0, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__chemistry__periodic-table__690853da__say.mp3", "sec": 14.1, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · earth/fossils-time", "key": "5203dc1b", "send": "第 3 层 · 泥盆纪砂岩。鱼骨（石化化石）。泥盆纪被称为“鱼类时代”。这条鱼被沙子迅速掩埋，地下水中的矿物质填满了骨骼里的微小空隙，使其变成石头（石化作用）。砂岩由海滩、河流或沙漠中的沙子形成。  〔朗读稿：第三层，泥盆纪砂岩。鱼骨，石化化石。泥盆纪被称为“鱼类时代”。这条鱼被沙子迅速掩埋，地下水中的矿物质填满了骨骼里的微小空隙，使其变成石头，石化作用。砂岩由海滩、河流或沙漠中的沙子形成。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/earth/fossils-time/zh/5203dc1b.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__earth__fossils-time__5203dc1b__raw.mp3", "sec": 21.0, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__earth__fossils-time__5203dc1b__say.mp3", "sec": 21.3, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · geography/latitude-longitude", "key": "9c42112c", "send": "北纬 50.1 度 ,西经 113.2 度。北半球 · 西半球。北美洲 · 加拿大  〔朗读稿：北纬五十点一度，西经一百一十三点二度。北半球，西半球。北美洲，加拿大〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/geography/latitude-longitude/zh/9c42112c.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__geography__latitude-longitude__9c42112c__raw.mp3", "sec": 8.7, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__geography__latitude-longitude__9c42112c__say.mp3", "sec": 8.6, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · chemistry/formulas-valence", "key": "5336d3dc", "send": "改式前系数，只改变分子数。把 H2O 改写成 H2O2，则变成了另一种物质（过氧化氢）。  〔朗读稿：改式前系数，只改变分子数。把H二O改写成H二O二，则变成了另一种物质，过氧化氢。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/chemistry/formulas-valence/zh/5336d3dc.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__chemistry__formulas-valence__5336d3dc__raw.mp3", "sec": 9.2, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__chemistry__formulas-valence__5336d3dc__say.mp3", "sec": 9.4, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · geography/latitude-longitude", "key": "43545724", "send": "北纬 64.0 度 ,西经 46.9 度。北半球 · 西半球。北美洲 · 格陵兰岛  〔朗读稿：北纬六十四点零度，西经四十六点九度。北半球，西半球。北美洲，格陵兰岛〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/geography/latitude-longitude/zh/43545724.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__geography__latitude-longitude__43545724__raw.mp3", "sec": 8.7, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__geography__latitude-longitude__43545724__say.mp3", "sec": 8.7, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · geography/time-zones", "key": "2bd8eb6e", "send": "UTC减9。你点击的位置：北纬 69.3 度 ,西经 134.0 度 · 北美洲 · 加拿大 这个时区比 UTC 晚 9 小时(在本初子午线以西)。 “太阳时”经度每差 1 度 相差 4 分钟。而时区时间按整小时跳变，让相邻地区使用同一个时间。 官方时间可能不同：各国自己选择时区（例如全中国统一使用 UTC+8）。  〔朗读稿：UTC减九。你点击的位置：北纬六十九点三度，西经一百三十四点零度，北美洲，加拿大。这个时区比 UTC 晚九小时，在本初子午线以西。“太阳时”经度每差一度相差四分钟。而时区时间按整小时跳变，让相邻地区使用同一个时间。官方时间可能不同：各国自己选择时区，例如全中国统一使用 UTC加八。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/geography/time-zones/zh/2bd8eb6e.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__geography__time-zones__2bd8eb6e__raw.mp3", "sec": 30.4, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__geography__time-zones__2bd8eb6e__say.mp3", "sec": 30.9, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · chemistry/periodic-table", "key": "c0f3a677", "send": "镨。镧系元素。原子序数 59。第 57–71 号元素，放在表格下方第一行。用于强力磁铁、手机屏幕和激光器。  〔朗读稿：镨。镧系元素。原子序数五十九。第五十七到第七十一号元素，放在表格下方第一行。用于强力磁铁、手机屏幕和激光器。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/chemistry/periodic-table/zh/c0f3a677.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__chemistry__periodic-table__c0f3a677__raw.mp3", "sec": 13.4, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__chemistry__periodic-table__c0f3a677__say.mp3", "sec": 13.6, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · astronomy/big-bang", "key": "5422c2bd", "send": "类星体 3C 273。第一个被确认的类星体（1963 年）。这个星系中心的黑洞吞噬气体的速度极快，发出的光比整个星系亮几百倍。它的光出发时，地球上的生命还只有单细胞生物。  〔朗读稿：类星体三C二七三。第一个被确认的类星体，一九六三年。这个星系中心的黑洞吞噬气体的速度极快，发出的光比整个星系亮几百倍。它的光出发时，地球上的生命还只有单细胞生物。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/astronomy/big-bang/zh/5422c2bd.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__astronomy__big-bang__5422c2bd__raw.mp3", "sec": 18.4, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__astronomy__big-bang__5422c2bd__say.mp3", "sec": 18.0, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · astronomy/eclipses", "key": "9d0f164c", "send": "交点与食季。两个轨道面相交的地方。月球轨道穿过地球公转轨道面的两个点叫做交点。只有当新月或满月发生在交点附近时，才会出现食。交点大约每 6 个月与太阳排成一线一次，这段时间叫“食季”。每年至少发生两次日食（大多是日偏食）。食 等于 新月或满月 + 靠近交点。  〔朗读稿：交点与食季。两个轨道面相交的地方。月球轨道穿过地球公转轨道面的两个点叫做交点。只有当新月或满月发生在交点附近时，才会出现食。交点大约每六个月与太阳排成一线一次，这段时间叫“食季”。每年至少发生两次日食，大多是日偏食。食等于新月或满月加上靠近交点。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/astronomy/eclipses/zh/9d0f164c.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__astronomy__eclipses__9d0f164c__raw.mp3", "sec": 28.4, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__astronomy__eclipses__9d0f164c__say.mp3", "sec": 28.1, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · china/prc-founding", "key": "5eb278b7", "send": "易错点：结束的标志是1976年10月粉碎“四人帮”，不是1971年。“文化大革命”不是任何意义上的革命或社会进步。  〔朗读稿：易错点：结束的标志是一九七六年十月粉碎“四人帮”，不是一九七一年。“文化大革命”不是任何意义上的革命或社会进步。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/china/prc-founding/zh/5eb278b7.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__china__prc-founding__5eb278b7__raw.mp3", "sec": 11.6, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__china__prc-founding__5eb278b7__say.mp3", "sec": 11.6, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · math/coordinate-plane", "key": "480e59f0", "send": "顺序很重要！ (2, 3) 表示向右 2 、向上 3 ，这是完全不同的位置。同样两个数，却是不同的点。  〔朗读稿：顺序很重要！二、三表示向右二、向上三，这是完全不同的位置。同样两个数，却是不同的点。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/math/coordinate-plane/zh/480e59f0.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__math__coordinate-plane__480e59f0__raw.mp3", "sec": 10.7, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__math__coordinate-plane__480e59f0__say.mp3", "sec": 10.0, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · china/strategy-battles", "key": "634bcb69", "send": "官渡之战。200年。官渡（今河南中牟东北）。曹操 对 袁绍。曹操以少胜多，打败袁绍，为统一北方奠定了基础。军无辎重则亡，无粮食则亡。军队没有辎重（物资）就会失败，没有粮食就会失败。  〔朗读稿：官渡之战。二零零年。官渡，今河南中牟东北。曹操对袁绍。曹操以少胜多，打败袁绍，为统一北方奠定了基础。军无辎重则亡，无粮食则亡。军队没有辎重，物资，就会失败，没有粮食就会失败。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/china/strategy-battles/zh/634bcb69.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__china__strategy-battles__634bcb69__raw.mp3", "sec": 21.1, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__china__strategy-battles__634bcb69__say.mp3", "sec": 21.1, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · astronomy/star-life", "key": "5eb65791", "send": "锑。碰撞的中子星。两颗中子星相撞时形成：大量中子在一瞬间“堆”出很重的原子（“r 过程”）。天文学家在 2017 年亲眼看到了这样的事件。  〔朗读稿：锑。碰撞的中子星。两颗中子星相撞时形成：大量中子在一瞬间“堆”出很重的原子，“r 过程”。天文学家在二零一七年亲眼看到了这样的事件。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/astronomy/star-life/zh/5eb65791.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__astronomy__star-life__5eb65791__raw.mp3", "sec": 14.6, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__astronomy__star-life__5eb65791__say.mp3", "sec": 14.7, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · biology/protein-synthesis", "key": "eb25fe08", "send": "信使 RNA(mRNA)。基因的“工作副本”。mRNA 是单链，把基因的信息从细胞核带到核糖体。RNA 用碱基 U（尿嘧啶）代替 T，用核糖代替脱氧核糖。每 3 个碱基组成一个密码子。AUG 是起始密码子；UAA、UAG、UGA 是终止密码子。  〔朗读稿：信使 RNA，mRNA。基因的“工作副本”。mRNA 是单链，把基因的信息从细胞核带到核糖体。RNA 用碱基 U，尿嘧啶，代替 T，用核糖代替脱氧核糖。每三个碱基组成一个密码子。AUG 是起始密码子；UAA、UAG、UGA 是终止密码子。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/biology/protein-synthesis/zh/eb25fe08.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__biology__protein-synthesis__eb25fe08__raw.mp3", "sec": 24.7, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__biology__protein-synthesis__eb25fe08__say.mp3", "sec": 25.5, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · physics/simple-machines", "key": "0363552d", "send": "机械效益与功。机械把力放大了几倍。机械效益 等于 输出力 除以 输入力。机械效益为 4，表示 100 N 的动力能提起 400 N 的重物。功 等于 力 乘 距离，单位是焦耳，J，,1 J 等于 1 N 乘 1 m。机械效益为 4 时，要拉动 4 m 的绳子才能把重物提高 1 m：功不变（理想机械）。  〔朗读稿：机械效益与功。机械把力放大了几倍。机械效益等于输出力除以输入力。机械效益为四，表示一百牛的动力能提起四百牛的重物。功等于力乘距离，单位是焦耳，J，一焦等于一牛乘一米。机械效益为四时，要拉动四米的绳子才能把重物提高一米：功不变，理想机械。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/physics/simple-machines/zh/0363552d.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__physics__simple-machines__0363552d__raw.mp3", "sec": 28.7, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__physics__simple-machines__0363552d__say.mp3", "sec": 26.5, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · chemistry/periodic-table", "key": "b22a1780", "send": "铯。碱金属。原子序数 55。第 1 族（氢除外）。柔软、有光泽的金属，最外层有 1 个电子。与水反应非常剧烈，所以要保存在煤油里。  〔朗读稿：铯。碱金属。原子序数五十五。第一族，氢除外。柔软、有光泽的金属，最外层有一个电子。与水反应非常剧烈，所以要保存在煤油里。〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/chemistry/periodic-table/zh/b22a1780.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__chemistry__periodic-table__b22a1780__raw.mp3", "sec": 15.0, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（朗读稿）": {"src": "zh__chemistry__periodic-table__b22a1780__say.mp3", "sec": 15.1, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · china/new-era", "key": "4a527463", "send": "易错点：“五位一体”是总体布局（经济、政治、文化、社会、生态文明建设）；“四个全面”是战略布局；“创新、协调、绿色、开放、共享”是新发展理念。三组词常被混淆。", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/china/new-era/zh/4a527463.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__china__new-era__4a527463__raw.mp3", "sec": 17.3, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · biology/body-systems", "key": "1fa8dfdb", "send": "肾脏。过滤血液，形成尿液。两个豆子形状的器官，靠近后背，每个约拳头大小。每个肾脏里大约有一百万个微小的过滤单位（肾单位）。", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/biology/body-systems/zh/1fa8dfdb.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__biology__body-systems__1fa8dfdb__raw.mp3", "sec": 13.8, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · politics/constitution", "key": "97d3d60b", "send": "加强宪法监督。宪法的生命在于实施，宪法的权威也在于实施。全国人大及其常委会行使监督宪法实施的职权。一切法律、行政法规和地方性法规都不得同宪法相抵触；要推进合宪性审查工作，加强备案审查。一切违反宪法和法律的行为，必须予以追究。任何组织或者个人都不得有超越宪法和法律的特权。", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/politics/constitution/zh/97d3d60b.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__politics__constitution__97d3d60b__raw.mp3", "sec": 31.0, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · physics/measurements-density", "key": "a85355bd", "send": "保留原烧杯中的余液和液滴，称烧杯和剩余液体的总质量。", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/physics/measurements-density/zh/a85355bd.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__physics__measurements-density__a85355bd__raw.mp3", "sec": 5.8, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · politics/rights-duties", "key": "ccec09ac", "send": "行使权利有界限。公民行使权利不能超越它本身的界限，不能滥用权利。公民在行使自由和权利的时候，不得损害国家的、社会的、集体的利益和其他公民的合法的自由和权利。公民行使权利应依照法定程序，按照规定的活动方式、步骤和过程。例如：言论自由不包括侮辱、诽谤他人或在网上散布谣言。", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/politics/rights-duties/zh/ccec09ac.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__politics__rights-duties__ccec09ac__raw.mp3", "sec": 29.7, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · astronomy/sun-stars", "key": "51b631e9", "send": "行星状星云。温和地吐出发光气壳。垂死的恒星把外层气体温和地吹向太空，形成发光的气体外壳。名字里虽有“行星”，却和行星无关：早期望远镜里这些圆形云团看起来像行星。这些气体以后会成为形成新恒星和行星的原料。类太阳恒星的结局很温和：是“吐气”，不是“爆炸”。", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/astronomy/sun-stars/zh/51b631e9.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__astronomy__sun-stars__51b631e9__raw.mp3", "sec": 27.8, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · geography/africa-asia", "key": "25e834da", "send": "波斯湾。班超派甘英出使大秦，他到达波斯湾，是汉朝使者所到最远的地方。", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/geography/africa-asia/zh/25e834da.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh__geography__africa-asia__25e834da__raw.mp3", "sec": 7.8, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "zh · _shared", "key": "9b7276bb", "send": "喜马拉雅山脉。喜马拉雅山脉呈弧形分布在我国西南边境，主峰珠穆朗玛峰是世界最高峰。", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/_shared/zh/9b7276bb.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文）": {"src": "zh___shared__9b7276bb__raw.mp3", "sec": 9.5, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "en · china/prc", "key": "dd13458d", "send": "Memory rhyme: 2003, Yang Liwei: China’s first step into space.  〔朗读稿：Memory rhyme: two thousand three, Yang Liwei: China’s first step into space.〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-humanities/china/prc/en/dd13458d.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge Jenny（原文）": {"src": "en__china__prc__dd13458d__raw.mp3", "sec": 5.8, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge Jenny（朗读稿）": {"src": "en__china__prc__dd13458d__say.mp3", "sec": 5.8, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "en · physics/measurements-density", "key": "182ae923", "send": "The mass lost by the beaker is the 60 g gained by the cylinder. The drops behind stay in the second weighing.  〔朗读稿：The mass lost by the beaker is the sixty grams gained by the cylinder. The drops behind stay in the second weighing.〕", "target": "—", "takes": {"8B Serena（现在线上）": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-science/physics/measurements-density/en/182ae923.mp3", "sec": "", "pace": "—", "tries": "", "ok": true}, "Edge Jenny（原文）": {"src": "en__physics__measurements-density__182ae923__raw.mp3", "sec": 7.5, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge Jenny（朗读稿）": {"src": "en__physics__measurements-density__182ae923__say.mp3", "sec": 7.8, "pace": "—", "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "en · biology/diffusion", "key": "56115af1", "send": "Spreading fr